      "distance_miles": 30,
      "status": "planned",
      "description": "This run is approx 51KMS or 32 Miles and it's fairly easy going for the most part though there are a few undulating spots between the fourth bridge and Cramond. Also there is a short sharp steep hill section coming back out of Cramond bridge. If interested please get back to me by no later than Wednesday the 11th of November. Please keep in mind that from now until March 2027 there will be only 1 Run per month. The dates for these runs are as follows Saturday 14 November, Sunday 13th of December, Saturday the 9th of January and Sunday the 14th of February. In March we go back to two runs a month.",
